# Deployment and access context

Apply `.cursor/skills/deploy-server/SKILL.md` for deployment, server, Dokploy,
SSH, DNS, or access-vault work. Production applications deploy only through
Hostinger workflows and Compose definitions. Credentials are referenced by
secret name; plaintext belongs only in the encrypted operational vault flow.
